WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.089 --> 00:00:03.330
Satoru Gojo is an absolute monster.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:08.760
Activating his Domain Expansion for just an
instant is enough to knock any human in the

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.120
vicinity unconscious.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:17.390
Any longer than that, and they’ll be robbed
of their sanity, forced to experience every

00:00:17.390 --> 00:00:22.120
moment of their lives simultaneously until
they die.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:28.450
The plans of villains like Kenjaku solely
hinge on getting Gojo out of the way because

00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:32.290
he’s the sole force defending the Jujutsu
World.

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:38.790
And if he were on the other side, Jujutsu
High wouldn’t stand a chance against their

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:39.960
star teacher.

00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:45.200
After all, he’s a Special Grade Sorcerer
- And a Special Grade is a sorcerer with such

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:51.230
unlimited potential that the limits of their
power are measureless.

00:00:51.230 --> 00:00:54.760
Geto could create a massive army of Cursed
Spirits to control.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.880
Yuta could copy endless techniques of other
sorcerers.

00:00:57.880 --> 00:01:04.430
But Gojo doesn’t need the help of a single
Cursed Spirit or anyone else: Satoru Gojo

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:10.630
could eliminate all his competition in the
Jujutsu World without even trying.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:15.610
In Gojo’s past, the Star Plasma Vessel incident
was a massive turning point.

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:21.040
Gojo and Geto were an unstoppable team of
Special Grade sorcerers with the mission of

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.470
exorcising curses for Jujutsu High.

00:01:23.470 --> 00:01:30.500
That was until they had to go up against a
true monster: Toji Fushiguro AKA Megumi’s

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.500
papa.

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.256
Even though Gojo’s Six-Eyes gives him essentially
limitless [the screen should say PUN INTENDED]

00:01:34.256 --> 00:01:39.040
control over cursed energy, Toji very nearly
killed him and Geto.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:44.570
Thankfully, Gojo unlocked his ultimate technique:
Hollow Purple and managed to kill his future

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.640
star pupil’s dad.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:52.700
Originally, like Gojo, he’d thought that
sorcerers existed to protect non-sorcerers,

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:58.220
but after this event Geto slowly came to believe
that humans were inferior, taking to calling

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:01.390
them monkeys and working toward sorcerer supremacy.

00:02:01.390 --> 00:02:06.900
This led to the Jujutsu Kaisen we know and
love,or at least the Jujutsu Kaisen Zero we

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:11.270
know and love, with the two former besties
Gojo and Geto having to fight against one

00:02:11.270 --> 00:02:15.819
another as Gojo upheld the values of Jujutsu
High and sorcerers protecting non-sorcerers

00:02:15.819 --> 00:02:22.840
while Geto worked toward normal humans’
eradication.

00:02:22.840 --> 00:02:25.350
But what if things went differently?

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:31.250
What if Gojo…the most powerful sorcerer…also
became super evil?

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:37.120
Well, there are a few ways this could shake
out: Four to be exact, so today let’s look

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:46.580
at how JJK would play out differently if its
greatest hero became its most terrifying villain.

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:52.420
Scenario number one: Gojo turns evil and Geto
stays good.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:56.030
In this first hypothetical, we have a complete
role reversal.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:00.270
In this one, it’s not Geto who cracks based
on what the two experienced at the hands of

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:01.270
Toji.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:02.580
Instead, Gojo’s will breaks.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:08.040
In fact, let’s change it right there: This
time instead of Toji defeating them both and

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.610
then getting crushed by Hollow Purple on his
way out, he defeats Gojo and is ultimately

00:03:12.610 --> 00:03:15.890
defeated by Geto in the Tombs of the Star
Corridor.

00:03:15.890 --> 00:03:22.680
He does still kill Riko, but this time it’s
Geto who kills Toji instead of Gojo.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:28.390
This results in a huge blow to Gojo’s ego,
but a victory for Geto.

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:35.480
Gojo’s ego is about the size of a planet,
so seeing Geto succeed where he failed would

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.850
be hard for him to deal with.

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:44.500
He’s never lost before this, so Gojo has
a mental break as a result, deciding to break

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.990
with Jujutsu High instead of Geto, who stays
with them.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:53.480
However, I just don’t see Gojo developing
the same kind of disgust with normal humans

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:55.110
that Geto does.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:57.980
He loves rom-coms too much for that kind of
thing.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:04.010
However, I could see him breaking with Jujutsu
High and going solo to do his own thing.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.530
He’s too powerful to listen to the higher
ups anyway, but instead of leaving like Yuki

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:13.420
did to ride around on a cool motorcycle and
talk to impressionable young men, Gojo would

00:04:13.420 --> 00:04:17.160
be flexing his power without limit [PUN INTENDED
AGAIN].

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:23.420
The Jujutsu Higher-Ups would start receiving
reports of cursed energy output all over Japan.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:27.660
However, whenever their sorcerers would arrive
on the scene, they wouldn’t find Satoru

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.660
Gojo.

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:34.340
And they wouldn’t find Cursed Spirits, either
- just their bloodied remains and buildings

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.600
reduced to rubble.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:41.820
When Gojo would go rogue, he would be destroying
cursed spirits with little regard for collateral

00:04:41.820 --> 00:04:47.100
damage and causing tons of damage with his
insane powers, even though he wouldn’t be

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:49.440
harboring malice toward humanity in general.

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:55.570
He might, however, target humans he deems
evil such as the Star Religious group specifically.

00:04:55.570 --> 00:05:00.340
And in this scenario, Geto would have to be
the one to try and stop him.

00:05:00.340 --> 00:05:07.320
There are tons of fan drawings online where
we see what it would look like if Kenjaku

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:13.070
took over Gojo’s body instead of Geto’s…but
that actually doesn’t make sense if you

00:05:13.070 --> 00:05:14.070
think about it.

00:05:14.070 --> 00:05:18.820
You see, Kenjaku would probably love to have
Gojo’s cursed technique, but it actually

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:21.860
wouldn’t be needed for his plan.

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:27.449
He needs Geto’s cursed technique specifically,
because the maximum uzumaki ability is what

00:05:27.449 --> 00:05:32.940
allows him to take Mahito’s Idle Transfiguration
to break Tengen’s barrier during the Culling

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:37.160
Game.

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:42.759
Since Kenjaku needs Geto’s technique specifically,
I think this story still plays out with Evil

00:05:42.759 --> 00:05:48.919
Gojo defeating Good Boy Geto, with Geto’s
body then being taken over by Kenjaku.

00:05:48.919 --> 00:05:53.009
This time, since Gojo isn’t working for
Jujutsu High, he doesn’t get sealed away

00:05:53.009 --> 00:05:54.220
in the Prison Realm.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:59.410
Instead, he gets to show up and wreak absolute
havoc in the Culling Game, which’ll be great

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:04.669
for Kenjaku’s goal since the Culling Game
needs to release a ton of cursed energy for

00:06:04.669 --> 00:06:06.360
Kenjaku’s ritual to work.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:12.169
In this timeline, Gojo becomes the all time
Culling Game MVP racking up more points than

00:06:12.169 --> 00:06:16.289
anybody and taking out ancient sorcerers left
and right.

00:06:16.289 --> 00:06:20.949
Of course, we can’t just leave it at that
because I know you want to know what would

00:06:20.949 --> 00:06:25.870
happen if Kenjaku DID take over Gojo’s body.

00:06:25.870 --> 00:06:32.940
So here’s our second scenario: Geto stays
good, and Gojo becomes Kenjaku’s body instead.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:38.570
Well, first we’ve got to figure out how
Gojo dies so that Kenjaku is able to take

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.590
over his body?

00:06:40.590 --> 00:06:46.389
Since the only person - or curse - around
who’s able to be remotely a match for Gojo

00:06:46.389 --> 00:06:51.450
is Sukuna, Kenjaku is going to have to get
the King of Curses on his side.

00:06:51.450 --> 00:06:56.950
Luckily, Kenjaku’s son happens to be a perfect
vessel for Sukuna.

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:02.129
In this timeline, instead of abandoning the
body of Kaori Itadori, Kenjaku raises Yuji

00:07:02.129 --> 00:07:03.530
to be evil.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:09.379
They collect Sukuna fingers on the DL, with
Kenjaku feeding his son the worst snacks of

00:07:09.379 --> 00:07:15.060
all time to unleash Sukuna’s power so that
sonny dearest can eliminate Gojo.

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:19.449
Gojo would be wandering Japan, teleporting
here and there, eliminating curses.

00:07:19.449 --> 00:07:25.310
When suddenly Kaori and her beloved four-armed,
twenty finger eating son would show up to

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.090
give him the fight of his life.

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:32.530
Suddenly Gojo, despite his limitless cursed
technique would be pinned to the ground.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:37.070
Kaori Itadori’s reverse cursed technique
would use the power of gravity to pin him

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:42.599
to the ground long enough for Sukuna to slice
and dice him with the Malevolent Shrine.

00:07:42.599 --> 00:07:48.090
In this timeline, Geto is still good, so no
one’s coming to Gojo’s rescue.

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:53.860
Kenjaku is able to catch the Evil Gojo off
guard and through a tag team with Kenjaku

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:59.970
and Sukuna, they eliminate the world’s strongest
sorcerer - but barely, because even these

00:07:59.970 --> 00:08:04.360
two need all their strength to even actually
hit Gojo.

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:08.080
With him out of the way, there’s no need
to bother with Prison Realms.

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:13.310
Nothing is able to get in the way of Kenjaku’s
evil plans, so he goes ahead and takes Geto’s

00:08:13.310 --> 00:08:16.569
body, too and the Culling Game goes off without
a hitch.

00:08:16.569 --> 00:08:21.789
But now it’s time to get to the real juicy
stuff.

00:08:21.789 --> 00:08:26.570
This time instead of the roles being reversed
with Geto being the good one and Gojo being

00:08:26.570 --> 00:08:34.289
evil…Geto stays evil just like in the real
story, but Gojo is joining him in Villain

00:08:34.289 --> 00:08:39.810
Land…and let’s just say it’s not going
to go too well for the good guys.

00:08:39.810 --> 00:08:44.540
Scenario #3 is that after the Star Plasma
Vessel Incident, it’s not just Geto who

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.610
decides to defect from Jujutsu High.

00:08:46.610 --> 00:08:52.410
Instead, Gojo also becomes angry at how things
are run and becomes evil right along with

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:53.410
Geto.

00:08:53.410 --> 00:08:58.190
With both Gojo and Geto leaving, there’s
no one to vouch for Yuta Okkotsu.

00:08:58.190 --> 00:09:03.339
Originally the higher ups of the Jujutsu Society
wanted Yuta killed because his cursed spirit

00:09:03.339 --> 00:09:05.529
Rika is insanely powerful.

00:09:05.529 --> 00:09:10.720
It’s very possible that this is how things
would play out, but more likely if Gojo and

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:17.730
Geto both exist as threats to the established
order, they’d try to recruit Yuta in order

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:22.450
to use his Special Grade status to defend
against Gojo and Geto’s plans.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:28.010
Yuta and his classmates would be hard at work
on their studies, when suddenly an army of

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:30.470
Cursed Spirits would descend upon Jujutsu
High.

00:09:30.470 --> 00:09:36.750
Panda, Toge, and Maki would put up a courageous
fight, beating down untold numbers of curses.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:41.220
When it seemed like the onslaught was finally
dying down, they’d look behind them and

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.220
see them.

00:09:42.220 --> 00:09:48.230
The BFF’s Gojo and Geto, ready to take out
Jujutsu High now that their welcoming party

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.230
was over.

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:55.550
Yuta and Rika would fight their hardest, however,
just Geto alone was enough to almost take

00:09:55.550 --> 00:10:01.660
Yuta out, so the two together would absolutely
wreck the hero of Jujutsu Kaisen 0.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.100
Along with just about everybody else.

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:10.840
Kenjaku’s role in this story would have
to be much different since he’d be unlikely

00:10:10.840 --> 00:10:14.600
to take over either Geto or Gojo’s body.

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:19.440
More likely, Kenjaku would use his abilities
as a master manipulator to join with them

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:25.640
while actually using them for his own purposes,
just like he did with the Disaster Curses.

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:30.190
Either way, an evil team up of Gojo and Geto
is probably going to end up with Sorcerers

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:34.480
coming out of secrecy - they’d pull young
sorcerers away from their connection to the

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:40.800
established Jujutsu Society and likely usher
in an era of Jujutsu supremacy over normal

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:44.370
humans - or monkeys, as Geto would call them.

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:50.040
However, I just can’t see Gojo getting on
board with Geto’s philosophy of hating humans,

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:57.630
which leads us to our 4th scenario, and probaby
the most interesting one:

00:10:57.630 --> 00:11:03.440
In this scenario, Gojo and Geto both become
evil, but they’re partnered with one another,

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:07.800
they’re still against each other and walk
along their own villainous paths.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:12.950
This would introduce a multitude of different
factions that makes the conflict of Jujutsu

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:18.450
Kaisen far more interesting.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:23.810
While Geto turns evil due to his hatred of
humans, Gojo is going to turn evil just because

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:26.910
he lets his immense power get to his head.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:32.490
After all, even though Satoru Gojo is by far
the world’s strongest sorcerer, he’s still

00:11:32.490 --> 00:11:34.260
used as a pawn by the Jujutsu Society.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.260
Instead of listening to people like the Jujutsu
High principal and Master Tengen, Gojo would

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:36.260
try to ascend to the top of the Jujutsu Society,
reshaping it in his own image.

00:11:36.260 --> 00:11:40.970
Instead of listening to the old traditional
rules, he would go his own way, causing a

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:44.920
huge fracture in Jujutsu High.

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:50.070
Whereas a lot of the time, he uses his power
just to prevent the higher ups from killing

00:11:50.070 --> 00:11:55.690
young sorcerers with potential like Yuta and
Yuji, he’d recruit them to his own side

00:11:55.690 --> 00:11:57.410
as powerful assets.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:12:03.060
Surely, other sorcerers who feel outcast by
the major families would join him, too, such

00:12:03.060 --> 00:12:08.090
as Maki Zenin who is treated terribly by her
family.

00:12:08.090 --> 00:12:12.320
Other sorcerers who are part of the big families
would stay at the sides, so this would lead

00:12:12.320 --> 00:12:17.740
to an all out war between the elders of clans
like the Zenin and the Kamo and the younger

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:20.180
sorcerers who side with Gojo.

00:12:20.180 --> 00:12:24.680
Sadly, Panda would also remain on the side
of the Old Guard, since the principal of Jujutsu

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.140
High created him.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:33.149
Unlike Geto who wants to destroy humans, Gojo
would still want to protect humanity, but

00:12:33.149 --> 00:12:38.070
his newfound vanity and overconfidence would
mean he’d no longer do it from the shadows.

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:44.860
Instead, he would shed the secrecy of Jujutsu
High and let it be known far and wide that

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:50.260
sorcerers were responsible for protecting
humanity from the danger of curses.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:55.850
He may even take a cue from Yuki and aim to
teach normal humans how to control cursed

00:12:55.850 --> 00:13:01.310
energy to prevent the birth of powerful curses
that accumulate from the negative energy released

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.870
by normal people.

00:13:02.870 --> 00:13:08.190
Yuki would likely be a powerful ally to Gojo
since she left on her own to try to rid the

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:13.120
world of the curses free of the restrictions
of Jujutsu Society’s higher ups.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:17.880
This was one of the suggestions she gave to
Geto for how to rid the world of curses, which

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:23.389
accidentally led him to the conclusion that
killing all non-sorcerers would be the most

00:13:23.389 --> 00:13:26.110
effective way of eliminating curses.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:30.750
And since that’s Geto’s goal, that means
that he’d still be at odds against Gojo

00:13:30.750 --> 00:13:34.680
when it came to the battle for the fate of
JJK’s world.

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:37.900
Meanwhile, Kenjaku is still lurking in the
shadows.

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:42.970
In all likelihood, unable to gather Gojo or
Geto’s bodies, he would probably still try

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:45.380
to ally with the Disaster Curses.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:52.190
This would lead to an all out war for the
fate of the Jujutsu Society.

00:13:52.190 --> 00:13:56.199
On one side, we have Suguru Geto and his followers,
such as Nanaka and Mimiko.

00:13:56.199 --> 00:13:59.779
In addition to the followers who could use
cursed energy, he’d also have all of the

00:13:59.779 --> 00:14:04.830
curses that he was able to gather using his
cursed technique, leading to an army of cursed

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.529
spirits on his side.

00:14:06.529 --> 00:14:11.709
Against him, would be Gojo’s group of young
sorcerers including Yuki and Yuta, giving

00:14:11.709 --> 00:14:14.480
them three Special Grades on their side.

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:18.680
Also throwing into the ring would be Kenjaku
in Kaori Itadori’s body and the Disaster

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:24.320
Curses, who wish to take advantage of the
conflict to massacre as many sorcerers as

00:14:24.320 --> 00:14:27.990
possible and pave the way for curses to take
over the world.

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:32.220
Kenjaku himself would also be taking advantage
of the chaos to try and eliminate Tengen’s

00:14:32.220 --> 00:14:37.400
barrier - he’d even possibly try to start
the Culling Game and use the fighting from

00:14:37.400 --> 00:14:39.699
this war to activate his ritual.

00:14:39.699 --> 00:14:45.070
And finally, we’d have Master Tengen and
the elders of the Three Big Jujutsu Families,

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:49.890
including many of the Gojo family who wouldn’t
appreciate Satoru going his own way.

00:14:49.890 --> 00:14:56.820
The battle would be bloody, leaving huge casualties
on every side - but there’s only one way

00:14:56.820 --> 00:15:00.600
it ultimately shakes out.

00:15:00.600 --> 00:15:05.430
Standing over what was once Jujutsu High,
Gojo’s Six-Eyes would look out over the

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:06.440
carnage.

00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.449
Principal Yaga and his puppet army would litter
the landscape.

00:15:09.449 --> 00:15:13.290
Jogo and the other Disaster Curses would sit
in cinders.

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:16.510
Even Geto and Kenjaku would be dead and gone.

00:15:16.510 --> 00:15:22.410
With Gojo’s side having three Special Grade
Sorcerers who totally eclipse lower ranked

00:15:22.410 --> 00:15:27.120
sorcerers, Gojo would ultimately win, and
would reshape the Jujutsu World in his own

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:28.880
beautiful blue-eyed image.

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:35.420
Of course, if Kenjaku was able to recruit
Sukuna as well, things might play out differently.

00:15:35.420 --> 00:15:40.480
But as it is, Gojo is the world’s strongest
sorcerer and there’s not a lot that can

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:45.760
stop him - after all thanks to his power,
practically nothing can even touch him.

00:15:45.760 --> 00:15:51.459
It really begs the question: is he just holding
back in all of his battles so far?

00:15:51.459 --> 00:15:55.870
And what would happen if he really let his
full strength fly?

00:15:55.870 --> 00:16:01.600
For example, at the Shibuya Incident, what
if he used his full strength against the Disaster

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:06.620
Curses instead of getting trapped in the Prison
Realm: You can find out all about that in

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:07.260
this video

